title: Be excited both to exist and to not exist.
pid: c441d336-3275-4f80-9c7c-9437781a5a99
body: |2-
  To be needed is good.
  To not be needed is good.
  Each of us needs to exercise humility.
  Be willing to let go of your accomplishments,
  if you or others find a better way.
contains:
- 78af0bde-80f3-4c98-ba7b-1b693e8ff8cb
